 href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%B9%E5%A5%A5%E5%A4%9A%E8%A5%BF%C2%B7%E5%A4%9A%E5%B8%83%E7%84%B6%E6%96%AF%E5%9F%BA\" title=\"費奧多西·多布然斯基\">Dobzhansky, Theodosius</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160303220935/http://people.ibest.uidaho.edu/~bree/courses/1_Dobzhansky_1964.pdf\">Biology, Molecular and Organismic</a> <span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PDF)</span>, American Zoologist, Nov 1964, <b>4</b> (4): 443–452, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.jstor.org/stable/3881145\"><span title=\"JSTOR\">JSTOR&#160;3881145</span></a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//doi.org/10.1093%2Ficb%2F4.4.443\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093%2Ficb%2F4.4.443\"><span title=\"數位物件識別號\">doi:10.1093/icb/4.4.443</span></a>, （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://people.ibest.uidaho.edu/~bree/courses/1_Dobzhansky_1964.pdf\">原始內容</a> <span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(PDF)</span>存檔於2016年3月3日）</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E9%83%BD%E8%AC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%BE%9E%E6%BC%94%E5%8C%96%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92%E4%BE%86%E7%9C%8B&amp;rft.atitle=Biology%2C+Molecular+and+Organismic&amp;rft.aufirst=Theodosius&amp;rft.aulast=Dobzhansky&amp;rft.date=1964-11&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.jtitle=American+Zoologist&amp;rft.pages=443-452&amp;rft.volume=4&amp;rft&#95;id=%2F%2Fwww.jstor.org%2Fstable%2F3881145&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fpeople.ibest.uidaho.edu%2F~bree%2Fcourses%2F1&#95;Dobzhansky&#95;1964.pdf&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1093%2Ficb%2F4.4.443&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-NCSE-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-NCSE_3-0\"><sup><b>3.0</b></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite