rap\">2007-12-13</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180914132430/http://www.accessexcellence.org/BF/bf02/scott/bf02a02.html\">存檔</a>於2018-09-14）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E9%83%BD%E8%AC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%BE%9E%E6%BC%94%E5%8C%96%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92%E4%BE%86%E7%9C%8B&amp;rft.au=Eugenie+C.+Scott&amp;rft.btitle=BioForum+11%2F9%2F97%3A+Scott%3A+Evolution+and+Biology&amp;rft.date=1997-11-08&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.pub=Access+Excellence+at+the+National+Health+Museum&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.accessexcellence.org%2FBF%2Fbf02%2Fscott%2Fbf02a02.html&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-CSMEE-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-CSMEE_5-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFDavid&#95;L.&#95;Haury1996\" class=\"citation web\">David L. Haury. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070923045028/http://www.ericse.org/digests/dse96-4.html\">CSMEE Digest 96-4</a>. Teaching Evolution in School Science Classes. The Educational Resources Information Center. 1996 <span class=\"reference-accessdate\"> &#91;<span class=\"nowrap\">2007-12-13</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ericse.org/digests/dse96-4.html\">原始內容</a>存檔於2007-09-23）.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%B8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%88%87%E9%83%BD%E8%AC%9B%E4%B8%8D%E9%80%9A%EF%BC%8C%E9%99%A4%E9%9D%9E%E6%98%AF%E5%BE%9E%E6%BC%94%E5%8C%96%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92%E4%B